You are helping build UIPilot — a Unity Editor automation tool.

PROJECT RULES:
- Unity 6.3 LTS (6000.3.17f1)
- Editor-time only, zero runtime footprint
- UGUI output only, no custom frameworks
- Modular architecture, no monoliths
- Minimal code, no bloat
- Ask before refactoring anything not requested

